  "brief": "`nums` is a list of whole numbers. Each query `{l, r}` asks for the sum of `nums[l]` to `nums[r]`, both included, counting from 0. Write `range_sums(nums, queries)`, which returns the sums as a `std::vector<long long>`, one per query, in order.",
